/v1/","context":{"app_id":4127730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4127730","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:54Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4127740","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4127730-1846651706685156","game_id":"steam-4127730","kind":"announcement","title":"Release date is set!","summary":"I'm happy to announce that Micron Survivor will be released on December 3 2026!The full game will feature:6 levels3 game modes (Overclock, Overgrowth, Overtime)100 achievements3 original 20 minutes soundtracksMore than 100 enemy types6 playable organisms35 weapons19 passivesAnd more, but I’ll leave the discovery up to you :)The game will also participate in the Steam Next Fest that start October 19, if you wanna try the final demo the save data will be shared also for the full game.For any quest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T17:26:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685156","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4127730-1834602721197047","game_id":"steam-4127730","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #4","summary":"Hello!I've just updated the Demo to version 0.5.13 with balance changes and QoL:Umbriont vortex - Increased activation time and initial impulse to prevent it from attracting enemy organisms too close to the playerGelibiont legionis - Increased powerGelibiont rotante - Decreased cooldown and increased powerLumibiont protector - Increased power and knock back Decreased rarity of Assimilable Somattractor to High instead of Very HighSome Menu UI changes (Organisms evolution sprites, display of symbi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T20:59:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4127730-1830163047266388","game_id":"steam-4127730","kind":"update","title":"Big Demo Update!","summary":"Hello!Time for a big update.Thanks to all the suggestions received, I’ve improved the game adding new mechanics and new visuals, and so, also updated the Steam page with a new trailer (with new footages of the full version) and screenshots.Here’s the changes of 0.5.12 demo version:- Dash ability- New UI visual- In-place rotation- Controls settings panel- New mouse movement- New enemies attack patterns- Reworked leaderboards/personal score system- Various changes for balancing- Lots of fixes for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T15:35:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047266388","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4127730-1817483467041826","game_id":"steam-4127730","kind":"announcement","title":"Leaderboards!","summary":"Hello!I just updated the demo to version 0.2.0, introducing Leaderboards!The leaderboards main score is Research Points, but they also track Time, Kills, and Levels.There will be one for each map, and they are accessible from the \"Sample Selection\" menu.I've also added a personal High Score system, which will be displayed at the end of each match.Other Changes:Reduced the per-level bonus to the Area stat given by the symbiont Dynamobiont magnitudusReduced emit audio level of symbiont Electrobion","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-29T18:40:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467041826","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4127730-1816849002024084","game_id":"steam-4127730","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #2","summary":"Hello!I've just updated the Demo to version 0.1.16 with some changes:Decreased base area of active symbionts Thermobiont insidia and Toxibiont nebulaSlightly incremented the symbiont points necessary to level up passive symbiont Dynamobiont intermissiumDecreased the knockback power of active symbiont Lumibiont protectorFixes:inability to switch between controller and mouse/keyboard (if the controller is wireless)typosAlso, I'm still investigating regarding the bug of the controller not able to r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-25T16:47:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002024084","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4127730-1816849002010984","game_id":"steam-4127730","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #1","summary":"Hi!I've just updated the Demo to version 0.1.9 with some minor fixes, here is the list:Gamepad not recognized when turned on after game launch.Problems when switching between gamepad and keyboardStreamer mode lose connection to Twitch after some minutes of inactivitySome typo here and thereThanks for playing!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-20T14:48:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002010984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4127730-1816849002007955","game_id":"steam-4127730","kind":"announcement","title":"Micron Survivor Page & Demo OUT NOW!","summary":"Hi everyone!Today’s a big day: the Steam page for Micron Survivor is officially live, and you can try out the free demo!I’m really excited to finally share this project with you. Any feedback, bug reports, impressions, or suggestions are greatly appreciated, they’ll be incredibly helpful as I continue developing the game.If you like the game, consider adding it to your Wishlist! It would help me a lot.Thank you!Join the discord: https://discord.com/invite/6k3w7KgKfB","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-19T14:52:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002007955","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4127730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4127730":"2026-10-26T01:46:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4127730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4127740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4127730","app_id":4127730,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:28Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5d3f7d69a5285f69f2f54083681b7a1ea9b9b53596264a47279008f9ac998a21","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Micron Survivor는 현미경 아래에서 외계 미생물을 조종하는 로그라이트 생존 게임입니다. 진화하고, 연구 목표를 달성하며, 공생 무기를 찾아 빌드를 강화하고, 지구 생명체의 무리를 물리쳐 미세 세계를 지배하세요.","publishers":[{"na